 taste and the topping really ads a great twist", "reviewRating": {"@type": "Rating", "bestRating": "5", "ratingValue": 5, "worstRating": "1"}}], "@context": "http://schema.org", "headline": "Key Lime Pie Martini", "keywords": "Liqueur Recipes,Vodka Recipes,Pineapples,Lime Recipes,Dairy Recipes,Cocktail Party,Fruit,Martini,American", "prepTime": "P0Y0M0DT0H5M0.000S", "nutrition": {"@type": "NutritionInformation", "calories": "873", "fatContent": "20g", "servingSize": "1 of 1 servings", "fiberContent": "3g", "sugarContent": "47g", "sodiumContent": "403mg", "proteinContent": "7g", "cholesterolContent": "41mg", "carbohydrateContent": "98g", "saturatedFatContent": "8g"}, "publisher": {"url": "https://www.foodnetwork.com", "logo": {"url": "https://food.fnr.sndimg.com/etc/clientlibs/assets/images/food/fn-logo-flat-60x60.png", "@type": "ImageObject", "width": "60", "height": "60"}, "name": "Food Network", "@type": "Organization"}, "totalTime": "P0Y0M0DT0H35M0.000S", "recipeYield": "1 drink", "dateModified": "2017-03-01T11:15:05.544-05:00", "datePublished": "2017-03-01T11:15:06.108-05:00", "recipeCuisine": "american", "recipeCategory": "beverage", "aggregateRating": {"@type": "AggregateRating", "ratingValue": 5, "reviewCount": 3}, "mainEntityOfPage": true, "recipeIngredient": ["Graham cracker crumbs, for rimming the glass", "2 lime wedges", "6 tablespoons (3 ounces) vanilla flavored vodka", "1/4 cup (2 ounces) key lime liqueur (recommended: KeKe Beach Key Lime Liqueur)", "2 tablespoons pineapple juice", "2 tablespoons heavy cream", "Ice cubes"], "recipeInstructions": [{"text": "Pour the graham cracker crumbs in a shallow dish. Rub a lime wedge around the edge of a martini glass and roll the edge in the graham cracker crumbs. Chill the glass for 30 minutes or until ready to serve.", "@type": "HowToStep"}, {"text": "Combine the vanilla vodka, key lime liqueur, pineapple juice, and cream in a shaker. Fill the shaker half full with ice and shake until well blended. Pour into pr